From Faraday's law of electomagnetic induction,

\begin{aligned}
e &=\frac{d \phi}{d t}=\frac{d(B A)}{l t}=\frac{d(B l l)}{d t} \\
&=\frac{B d l \times l}{d t}=B V l
\end{aligned}

Also, $F=i l B=\left(\frac{B V}{R}\right)\left(l^2 B\right)=\frac{B^2 l^2 V}{R}$
At equilibrium
